   2021},
Organization = {KES Int},
Abstract = {The article aims to present one of the methods of supporting
   decision-making by non-specialists, using the experience of experts in
   each field, in this case specialists using the services provided in the
   computing cloud model. The broad spectrum of cloud-based services makes
   it difficult for decision-makers to choose a single solution from among
   the many options available. A solution to the decision problem was
   proposed using the method of hierarchical analysis of decision problems.
   Five cloud service providers were selected, and the classification was
   made according to five criteria. The analysis is based on author's own
   research. (C) 2021 The Authors. Published by Elsevier B.V. This is an
