   \textbackslash{}setlength\{\textbackslash{}oddsidemargin\}\{-69pt\}
   \textbackslash{}begin\{document\}\$\$\_\{rgb\}\$\$\textbackslash{}end\{d
   ocument\}2Hem) to learn stain-aware embeddings, producing class-specific
   gradients for Grad-CAM-based fine-grained localization. Benchmarking
   against stain-specific SSL baselines (RGB2H, RGB2RGB,
   P\textbackslash{}documentclass{[}12pt]\{minimal\}
   \textbackslash{}usepackage\{amsmath\}
   \textbackslash{}usepackage\{wasysym\}
   \textbackslash{}usepackage\{amsfonts\}
