   {document\}), supervised ResNet-50, and Pathology Foundation models
   (UNI, Virchow2, H-Optimus-1, CONCH), Keratin-Net achieved
   in-distribution AUC of 0.99 and F1 of 94.48 +/- 0.01\%, and maintained
   strong out-of-distribution performance (F1 = 92.48 +/- 1.34\%).
   Patch-level localization reached IoU 0.597 and Dice 0.732, surpassing
   all baselines. Despite its compact design (1.18M parameters, 7 MB
